# Cloudflare Pages 缓存策略（D-130）
# Astro 产物指纹路径与 v2 素材 immutable；HTML 短缓存便于内容更新生效
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/manifest/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
